screen.mdws.storm_escape.mode.hard.initi:
Additional Hard Mode rules: all Classic Mode rules still apply;
At 10/20/40 Storm Points, the Command Block upgrades to Chain/Repeating/Rainbow respectively;
Chain requires 6 hits and improves internal rewards; Repeating requires 8, gives better rewards, and frequently launches flaming Wither Storm missiles; Rainbow starts at 12 hits, gains 1 hit per absorbed unbreakable block, and deals physical melee damage while pulling entities. Gravity reverses after the fourth hit.
